    fmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, "Warning: failed to add dependency %s -> %s: %v\n", issue.ID, dependsOnID, err)
}
```

**Analysis:** ✅ Correct - Dependencies are auxiliary to issue creation. The issue exists even if dependencies fail.

### 2. Label Addition
**create.go:338-342**
